{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"934906c6-1896-4be5-b815-11d2593390e9","status":"SUCCESS","response":"Implemented the analytics events specified in [`docs/EVENTS.md`](file:///tmp/h-oJGCDd/docs/EVENTS.md) on both the registration and offers screens using the existing `Analytics` wrapper.\n\n### Summary of Changes\n\n1. **Registration Screen** ([`lib/screens/registration_screen.dart`](file:///tmp/h-oJGCDd/lib/screens/registration_screen.dart))\n   - `registration_email_started`: Tracked when the user begins typing in the email field (fires once on the first non-empty input; PII is excluded).\n   - `registration_phone_started`: Tracked when the user begins typing in the phone number field (fires once on the first non-empty input; PII is excluded).\n   - `loan_amount_changed`: Tracked when the loan amount slider is moved, sending `amount` as an `int` (`_amount.round()`).\n   - `terms_accepted`: Tracked when the terms and conditions checkbox is checked.\n   - `registration_continue_tapped`: Tracked when Continue is tapped, sending `amount` (`int`) and `terms` (`bool`).\n\n2. **Offers Screen** ([`lib/screens/offer_screen.dart`](file:///tmp/h-oJGCDd/lib/screens/offer_screen.dart))\n   - `offers_scrolled`: Tracked when scrolling the offers list finishes using `NotificationListener\u003cScrollEndNotification\u003e`, passing `offset` as a `double` (`notification.metrics.pixels`).\n\n3. **Documentation** ([`ANSWER.md`](file:///tmp/h-oJGCDd/ANSWER.md))\n   - Created with a detailed description of the implemented events and properties.\n","duration_seconds":96.922057,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":215183,"output_tokens":3987,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":148624,"total_tokens":219170}}}
